g the Linux command-line convert program) When done, the program should leave the following in the directory in which it was invoked. (That is, if you were in foo/ when you invoked album, then all these things go into foo/) a file index.html containing, for each photo: a properly oriented thumbnail a caption a link from the thumbnail to a properly oriented medium-size version of the photo the thumbnails and medium-size versions.","topics":[],"score":191513,"global_rank":350412},{"name":"twalker/zmk-brain","owner":"twalker","html_url":"https://github.com/twalker/zmk-brain","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Zmk firmware for brain keyboard","topics":[],"score":191506,"global_rank":350419},{"name":"upbound/caas-test","owner":"upbound","html_url":"https://github.com/upbound/caas-test","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":191506,"global_rank":350420},{"name":"sup/cs-hw-template","owner":"sup","html_url":"https://github.com/sup/cs-hw-template","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"TeX","description":":page_facing_up: Templates for homework, project design docs, and more for Cornell CS classes. ","topics":[],"score":191505,"global_rank":350422},{"name":"lindison/minecraft","owner":"lindison","html_url":"https://github.com/lindison/minecraft","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Shell","description":null,"topics":[],"score":191505,"global_rank":350425},{"name":"hmorzaria/Atlantis_tuning","owner":"hmorzaria","html_url":"https://github.com/hmorzaria/Atlantis_tuning","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"R","description":"Plot code for Atlantis tuning","topics":[],"score":191505,"global_rank":350426},{"name":"leakingtapan/reactive-design-patterns","owner":"leakingtapan","html_url":"https://github.com/leakingtapan/reactive-design-patterns","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Scala","description":"S